#: ../../docs/faq/account.rst:8 36ab220bd922472cafa12b65501a2b39
msgid "账号申请"
msgstr "Account Application"

#: ../../docs/faq/account.rst:10 8b20eedede144721b3dcd12af18e6566
msgid ""
"请先阅读 userguide_ . 并通过 cnSRC统一身份门户 portal_  门户进行注册申请。 "
"我们会在3个工作日内开通账号并将账号信息发送至您的邮箱， 如有其他问题请并发送邮件至至 cnSRC运维 mailto_ 。"
msgstr ""
"Please read userguide_ first. Apply for registration through the cnSRC "
"unified identity portal portal_. We will activate your account within 3 "
"working days and send account information to your email. If you have other "
"questions, please email cnSRC operations mailto_."

#: ../../docs/faq/account.rst:15 9d46bfdc0aae4120a207f2265d029f6d
msgid "另外，为帮助用户正确使用cnSRC超算资源，请账号使用人先通读“cnSRC用户手册”。"
msgstr ""
"Also, to help users use cnSRC supercomputing resources correctly, account "
"holders should read the \"cnSRC User Guide\" first."

